  "title": "Under Armour Basketball Introduces the Fox 3",
  "summary": "The Under Armour Fox 3 was built to meet the lightning-quick first step, elite end-to-end speed and the ability to stop on a dime, turning full-speed attacks into controlled finishes, kickouts and game-changing plays of De'Aaron Fox. A lightweight performance Basketball shoe. Tailored to enhance his style of play: explosive speed with the control to brake, plant and attack again. That balance between speed and control is the foundation of this sneaker, and every element is designed to support the dynamic nature of his game.",
